{"id":3118,"slug":"3118-property-decorator-dung-the-nao","category":"Python","subcategory":"OOP","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"`@property` decorator dùng thế nào?","question_en":"How does the `@property` decorator work?","answer_vi":"`@property` cho phép define getter/setter/deleter cho attribute, truy cập như attribute thường nhưng có validation logic.\n```python\nclass Temperature:\n    def __init__(self, celsius: float):\n        self._celsius = celsius\n\n    @property\n    def celsius(self) -> float:\n        return self._celsius\n\n    @celsius.setter\n    def celsius(self, value: float):\n        if value < -273.15:\n            raise ValueError(\"Below absolute zero!\")\n        self._celsius = value\n\n    @property\n    def fahrenheit(self) -> float:  # Read-only derived property\n        return self._celsius * 9/5 + 32\n\nt = Temperature(25)\nt.celsius = 30      # Gọi setter tự động\nprint(t.fahrenheit) # 86.0\n```","answer_en":"@property lets you define getter/setter/deleter, accessed like a plain attribute but with validation.\n```python\nclass Circle:\n    def __init__(self, radius):\n        self._radius = radius\n\n    @property\n    def radius(self): return self._radius\n\n    @radius.setter\n    def radius(self, r):\n        if r < 0: raise ValueError()\n        self._radius = r\n\n    @property\n    def area(self): return 3.14 * self._radius ** 2\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>@property</code> cho phép define getter/setter/deleter cho attribute, truy cập như attribute thường nhưng có validation logic.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class Temperature:\n    def __init__(self, celsius: float):\n        self._celsius = celsius\n\n    @property\n    def celsius(self) -&gt; float:\n        return self._celsius\n\n    @celsius.setter\n    def celsius(self, value: float):\n        if value &lt; -273.15:\n            raise ValueError(&quot;Below absolute zero!&quot;)\n        self._celsius = value\n\n    @property\n    def fahrenheit(self) -&gt; float:  # Read-only derived property\n        return self._celsius * 9/5 + 32\n\nt = Temperature(25)\nt.celsius = 30      # Gọi setter tự động\nprint(t.fahrenheit) # 86.0\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Temperature</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">__init__</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, celsius: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">float</span></span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._celsius = celsius\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @property</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">celsius</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">float</span>:\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._celsius\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @celsius.setter</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">celsius</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, value: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">float</span></span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> value &lt; -<span class=\"hljs-number\">273.15</span>:\n            <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">raise</span> ValueError(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Below absolute zero!&quot;</span>)\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._celsius = value\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @property</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fahrenheit</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">float</span>:  <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Read-only derived property</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._celsius * <span class=\"hljs-number\">9</span>/<span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span> + <span class=\"hljs-number\">32</span>\n\nt = Temperature(<span class=\"hljs-number\">25</span>)\nt.celsius = <span class=\"hljs-number\">30</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Gọi setter tự động</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">print</span>(t.fahrenheit) <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 86.0</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p>@property lets you define getter/setter/deleter, accessed like a plain attribute but with validation.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class Circle:\n    def __init__(self, radius):\n        self._radius = radius\n\n    @property\n    def radius(self): return self._radius\n\n    @radius.setter\n    def radius(self, r):\n        if r &lt; 0: raise ValueError()\n        self._radius = r\n\n    @property\n    def area(self): return 3.14 * self._radius ** 2\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Circle</span>:\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">__init__</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, radius</span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._radius = radius\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @property</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">radius</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._radius\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @radius.setter</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">radius</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, r</span>):\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> r &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>: <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">raise</span> ValueError()\n        <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._radius = r\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @property</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">area</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">3.14</span> * <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>._radius ** <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span></code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3115-4-nguyen-ly-oop-trong-python","title":"4 nguyên lý OOP trong Python?"},{"url":"/q/3116-classmethod-vs-staticmethod-vs-instance-method","title":"`@classmethod` vs `@staticmethod` vs instance method?"},{"url":"/q/3117-mro-method-resolution-order-la-gi-python-giai-quyet-diamond-problem-the-nao","title":"MRO (Method Resolution Order) là gì? Python giải quyết diamond problem thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3119-abstract-class-trong-python-dung-the-nao","title":"Abstract class trong Python — dùng thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3120-dataclass-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-class-thuong","title":"`@dataclass` là gì? Lợi ích so với class thường?"},{"url":"/q/3121-slots-la-gi-khi-nao-nen-dung","title":"`__slots__` là gì? Khi nào nên dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3122-cac-dunder-methods-quan-trong-nhat-can-biet","title":"Các dunder methods quan trọng nhất cần biết?"},{"url":"/q/3101-python-quan-ly-bo-nho-nhu-the-nao","title":"Python quản lý bộ nhớ như thế nào?"}]}